    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 0 · Fetch Document (shared sub-workflow)\nTakes a URL, returns plain text + language. PDFs (government and conference reports) go through PDF extraction, web pages through HTML extraction.\nCalled from two places: the **Search Agent's Read Document tool** and the **extraction pipeline** (full text).\nLanguage is detected from the script (Bengali / Devanagari / Thai / Latin); the original text is kept, translation is left to the extraction skill.",
        "width": 1180,
        "height": 123,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "403f41d8-ac80-58f2-8304-f1ca6e8c89bf",
      "name": "Note",
